# `<`, `<=`, `>` and `>=` on two Ints and on two Floats.
puts 1 < 2, 2 < 1, 2 < 2
puts 1 <= 2, 2 <= 1, 2 <= 2
puts 1 > 2, 2 > 1, 2 > 2
puts 1 >= 2, 2 >= 1, 2 >= 2
puts -5 < -4
puts 1.5 < 2.5, 2.5 <= 2.5, 2.5 > 2.5, 2.5 >= 2.5
puts -0.5 < 0.0
a = 3
b = 7
puts a < b, a > b, a <= b, a >= b
same = (a < b) == (b > a)
puts same
